data: {"id": "b2a2cf6d85734516-final", "run_id": "b2a2cf6d85734516", "seq": 1750, "ts_ms": 1789112593678, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v02/workload` | Pending | Pod workload in aiops-case-v02 is stuck in Pending state due to FailedScheduling |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedScheduling ... 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory.` (fact-8e8fda6cf0d3) | 调度器明确判定所有节点因内存不足无法调度 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container.resource_request.memory` 设置为 `1Pi` (fact-75712edd855d) | 定义异常的源：单容器请求了远超常规物理机的极大内存 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod `workload` 状态持续为 `Pending` (fact-d9136a14595b) | 确认 Pod 因上述原因长期无法进入运行态 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container.resource_limit.memory` 同样设置为 `1Pi` (fact-74bfab97f558) | 限制值与请求值一致，进一步阻断了任何弹性调度的可能 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nK8s Event 直接指出了 3 个节点全部因 `Insufficient memory` 拒绝调度的事实，结合 K8s Config 中高达 `1Pi` 的请求值（事实 2），确证了集群物理资源无法满足该调度条件。Pod 的 `Pending` 状态（事实 3）是这一冲突的必然结果。Metrics 层面由于 Pod 未启动，仅能侧面印证未进入正常/失败运行状态，无更多可量化的时序趋势支持。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n```text\nContainer 'app' configured with memory limit/request of 1Pi (fact-2, 4) \n→ Scheduler evaluates cluster nodes (3 total) against 1Pi requirement \n→ All 3 nodes report Insufficient memory, preventing binding (fact-1) \n→ Pod remains in Pending state indefinitely (fact-3)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n**已确认根因**：Pod 中容器 `app` 错误配置了 `1Pi`（1 Pebibyte）的内存请求与限制。集群所有 3 个节点均无法满足此资源请求，导致调度器反复 `FailedScheduling`，使得 Pod 长期处于 `Pending` 状态。\n\n**证据支撑**：\n- 调度器事件明确归因为 `3 Insufficient memory`（事实 1）。\n- 容器配置事实明确记录请求与限制均为 `1Pi`（事实 2、4）。\n- 集群节点总数确认为 3，且全部拒绝（事实 1 原文）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 33.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 36.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v02/workload: 36.7s (Evidence 30.1s, RCA 6.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v02/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 78.637, "metrics": {"run_id": "b2a2cf6d85734516", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 78.64407444000244, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "50%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.9, "weighted_score": 0.18, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 90%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 78644.07444000244, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 75182.5304031372, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 9, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 7693.980693817139, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3168.567657470703}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 33233.39772224426, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集